<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> - Perpustakaan SMA N 1 Sleman</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="layout">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-brand"><img src="/img/logo-sma-n1-sleman.png" alt="Logo SMA N 1 Sleman" class="sidebar-logo"><span>Perpus SMA N 1 Sleman</span></div>
      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <a href="/user/dashboard" class="nav-link">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/user/katalog" class="nav-link">Katalog Buku</a>
        <a href="/user/peminjaman" class="nav-link">Peminjaman</a>
        <a href="/user/pengembalian" class="nav-link">Pengembalian</a>
        <a href="/user/denda" class="nav-link">Denda & Pembayaran</a>
        <a href="/user/riwayat" class="nav-link">Riwayat</a>
        <a href="/user/bantuan" class="nav-link active">Bantuan</a><a href="/user/profil" class="nav-link">Profil</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="sidebar-user">
        <span class="sidebar-user-role"><%= currentUser.role %></span>
        <span class="sidebar-user-name"><%= currentUser.username %></span>
        <form action="/logout" method="POST">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Logout</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main">
      <header class="topbar">
        <h1>Bantuan &amp; Customer Service</h1>
        <div class="topbar-right">
          <div class="live-clock" id="liveClock">--:--:-- WIB</div>
          <span class="badge"><%= currentUser.role %></span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <script>
        function tickClock() {
          const el = document.getElementById('liveClock');
          if (el) {
            try {
              el.textContent = new Date().toLocaleTimeString('id-ID', { timeZone: 'Asia/Jakarta' }) + ' WIB';
            } catch (e) {
              el.textContent = new Date().toLocaleTimeString('id-ID') + ' WIB';
            }
          }
        }
        tickClock();
        setInterval(tickClock, 1000);
      </script>

      <div class="content">
        <% if (message) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible">
            <%= message %>
            <button class="alert-close" onclick="this.parentElement.style.display='none'">&times;</button>
          </div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (error) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-error alert-dismissible">
            <%= error %>
            <button class="alert-close" onclick="this.parentElement.style.display='none'">&times;</button>
          </div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h2>💬 Pusat Bantuan Perpustakaan</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Punya kendala? Kirim pertanyaan Anda di bawah ini. Admin/Petugas Perpustakaan SMA N 1 Sleman
            akan menjawab seputar peminjaman, pengembalian, denda, hingga masalah akun.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h2>📝 Kirim Pertanyaan</h2>
          </div>
          <form action="/user/bantuan" method="POST">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="subjek">Subjek</label>
              <input type="text" id="subjek" name="subjek" placeholder="Contoh: Kendala login / perpanjang peminjaman" required>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="pesan">Isi Pertanyaan</label>
              <textarea id="pesan" name="pesan" rows="4" placeholder="Tuliskan kendala atau pertanyaan Anda..." required></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Kirim Pertanyaan</button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h2>📬 Riwayat Pertanyaan Saya</h2>
          </div>
          <% if (typeof tableReady !== 'undefined' && tableReady === false) { %>
            <div class="empty">Fitur riwayat pertanyaan belum aktif. Kirim tetap bisa dicoba; jika tidak tersimpan, silakan hubungi petugas / admin perpustakaan langsung.</div>
          <% } else if (tiket.length === 0) { %>
            <div class="empty">Belum ada pertanyaan yang Anda kirim.</div>
          <% } else { %>
            <div class="table-responsive">
              <table class="table">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>No</th>
                    <th>Subjek</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th>Tanggal</th>
                    <th>Jawaban Admin</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <% tiket.forEach((t, i) => { %>
                  <tr>
                    <td><%= i + 1 %></td>
                    <td>
                      <strong><%= t.subjek %></strong><br>
                      <small class="text-muted"><%= t.pesan %></small>
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      <span class="badge <%= t.status === 'menunggu' ? 'badge-warning' : t.status === 'dibalas' ? 'badge-success' : 'badge-default' %>">
                        <%= t.status %>
                      </span>
                    </td>
                    <td><%= new Date(t.created_at).toLocaleDateString('id-ID') %><br><small class="text-muted"><%= new Date(t.created_at).toLocaleTimeString('id-ID', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }) %></small></td>
                    <td>
                      <% if (t.jawaban) { %>
                        <span class="text-muted"><%= t.jawaban %></span>
                      <% } else { %>
                        <span class="text-muted">Menunggu jawaban admin...</span>
                      <% } %>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <% }) %>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          <% } %>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-grid">
          <div class="cs-box">
            <span class="cs-box-icon">🔑</span>
            <h3>Lupa / Ganti Password</h3>
            <p>
              Tidak dapat masuk karena lupa atau salah kata sandi? Hubungi admin untuk mereset
              password akun Anda. Siapkan username atau NIS Anda agar proses lebih cepat.
            </p>
            <span class="cs-box-tag">Admin &amp; Petugas Perpustakaan</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-box">
            <span class="cs-box-icon">📕</span>
            <h3>Peminjaman &amp; Pengembalian</h3>
            <p>
              Pertanyaan seputar cara meminjam, batas waktu, atau perpanjangan peminjaman buku dapat
              ditanyakan langsung kepada petugas perpustakaan.
            </p>
            <span class="cs-box-tag">Senin–Jumat · 07.00–16.00 WIB</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-box">
            <span class="cs-box-icon">💳</span>
            <h3>Denda &amp; Pembayaran</h3>
            <p>
              Butuh penjelasan mengenai denda keterlambatan atau cara membayar? Hubungi petugas untuk
              konsultasi dan penyelesaian admin denda Anda.
            </p>
            <span class="cs-box-tag">Layanan Siswa</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <h2>📞 Kontak Customer Service</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-contacts-wide">
            <div class="cs-contact-item">
              <span class="cs-icon">📞</span>
              <div>
                <span class="cs-label">Telepon</span>
                <span class="cs-value">(0274) 868434</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cs-contact-item">
              <span class="cs-icon">✉️</span>
              <div>
                <span class="cs-label">Email</span>
                <span class="cs-value">info@sman1sleman.sch.id</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cs-contact-item">
              <span class="cs-icon">📍</span>
              <div>
                <span class="cs-label">Lokasi Perpustakaan</span>
                <span class="cs-value">Jl. Magelang Km 14,4 Medari, Caturharjo, Sleman, Yogyakarta</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="mailto:info@sman1sleman.sch.id" class="btn btn-primary">💬 Hubungi Customer Service</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>